WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.910
Nvidia's Jensen Huang

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:03.050
just resigned.

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.400
The headlines say:

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.890
a reported affair,

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.050
and a woman U.S. officials

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.390
call a Chinese spy.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:10.580
But rewind.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:12.350
In 2022,

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.850
Washington banned his best AI chips

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:15.590
from China.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:16.730
So Huang built

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:18.240
a weaker chip for China.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.800
In 2025,

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.030
that was banned too.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:22.650
So he went to Trump,

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:23.590
and made a deal:

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.800
sell the chips,

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.460
and give the government a cut.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.080
First fifteen percent.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.310
Then twenty-five.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:31.200
China hawks hated it.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.710
Then, in October 2026,

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.700
U.S. officials told

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.650
the New York Times

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:36.550
about the relationship

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.570
and the spy claim.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.650
Beijing calls it fabrication.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:40.860
Two weeks later,

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:41.720
he was out.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.650
A real security risk?

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:45.180
Or a dealmaker removed?

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:46.850
The public has not seen

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:47.400
the evidence.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.440
What do you think?
